{
  "//": "Plays one whole hand in the web build with clicks only: no dragging, no injected state. Before the tap path existed this was impossible - a card could only be moved by dragging and the flow vocabulary has no drag step, so nothing outside the tray was ever reachable. The seed is pinned and the plan is the one the domain produces for it (see app/test/play_through_test.dart), so the outcome is fixed: top Qd/6h/8h, middle 5d/Qh/Qs/Td/8d, bottom 3c/Js/3h/4h/Ac, which fouls.",
